  "title": "AGTTM Part 9 - Sample Layouts",
  "abstract": "AGTTM Part 9 provides a comprehensive collection of sample traffic guidance scheme layouts for various traffic management scenarios. The document serves as an essential reference guide containing detailed diagrams for lane closures, shoulder closures, mobile works, short-term setups, and emergency configurations. Each layout includes speed zone requirements, signage schedules, and spacing tables to assist traffic management designers in creating compliant site-specific traffic management plans.",
